    "description": {
      "content": "Read-only API for finding verified Georgian legal specialists. Designed for AI agents (Perplexity, ChatGPT, Claude, Custom GPTs, MCP servers) and third-party integrations. Supports Georgian, English, and Russian. Sending an inquiry requires sign-in on legal.ge and is not exposed here.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: legal.ge\n Email: contact@legal.ge",
